            "arabic_text": "مُحَمَّدُ بْنُ أَحْمَدَ بْنِ يَحْيَى عَنْ أَحْمَدَ بْنِ مُحَمَّدٍ عَنِ الْحُسَيْنِ بْنِ سَعِيدٍ عَنِ ابْنِ أَبِي عُمَيْرٍ عَنْ حَنَانِ بْنِ سَدِيرٍ قَالَ:",
            "chunk_type": "isnad",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "Muhammad ibn Ahmad ibn Yahya, from Ahmad ibn Muhammad, from al-Husayn ibn Sa'id, from Ibn Abi 'Umayr, from Hanan ibn Sudayr, who said:",
              "es": "",
              "fa": "",
              "fr": "",
              "id": "",
              "ru": "",
              "tr": "",
              "ur": "",
              "zh": ""
            },
            "word_end": 22,
            "word_start": 0
          },
          {
            "arabic_text": "سَمِعْتُ رَجُلًا سَأَلَ أَبَا عَبْدِ اللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ فَقَالَ: إِنِّي رُبَّمَا بُلْتُ فَلَا أَقْدِرُ عَلَى الْمَاءِ وَيَشْتَدُّ ذَلِكَ عَلَيَّ.",
            "chunk_type": "opening",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "I heard a man ask Aba 'Abd Allah عليه السلام, and he said: “At times I urinate and cannot access water, and that becomes difficult for me.”",
              "es": "",
              "fa": "",
              "fr": "",
              "id": "",
              "ru": "",
              "tr": "",
              "ur": "",
              "zh": ""
            },
            "word_end": 41,
            "word_start": 22
          },
          {
            "arabic_text": "فَقَالَ: «إِذَا بُلْتَ وَتَمَسَّحْتَ فَامْسَحْ ذَكَرَكَ بِرِيقِكَ، فَإِنْ وَجَدْتَ شَيْئًا فَقُلْ: هَذَا مِنْ ذَاكَ».",
            "chunk_type": "body",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "So he عليه السلام said: “When you urinate and wipe yourself, then wipe your male organ with your saliva. Then if you find something, say: this is from that.”",
              "es": "",
              "fa": "",
              "fr": "",
              "id": "",
              "ru": "",
              "tr": "",
              "ur": "",
              "zh": ""
            },
            "word_end": 55,
            "word_start": 41
          }
